DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The ttxxpp driver provides support for the 3Com Typhoon/Sidewinder Fast Eth‐
     ernet chipset, including the following:

           ••   3Com 3CR990-TX-95
           ••   3Com 3CR990-TX-97
           ••   3Com 3CR990SVR95
           ••   3Com 3CR990SVR97

     The ttxxpp driver supports IPv4 receive IP/TCP/UDP checksum offload, IPv4
     transmit IP checksum offload, and VLAN tag insertion and stripping.

     The ttxxpp driver supports the following media types:

     aauuttoosseelleecctt
